{"type":"message","id":"123d4dfc","parentId":"509bef6c","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:00:09.215Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 03:00 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为查事小弟，用playwright访问厦门火炬高技术产业开发区网站 http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/zfxxgkml/glfw/，找到通知公告/政策栏目，提取以下CSS选择器：\n1. 公告列表容器选择器\n2. 单个公告条目选择器\n3. 公告标题选择器\n4. 公告跳转链接选择器\n5. 公告发布日期选择器\n返回选择器和验证结果，确保能正确提取最新开发区政策公告。"}],"timestamp":1773428409214}}
{"type":"message","id":"b999c2b4","parentId":"123d4dfc","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:00:21.372Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nGot it, I need to complete this task: use Playwright to access that Xiamen Torch website, find the notice/policy section, extract those 5 CSS selectors, then return them with verification results.\nFirst, I should create a simple Playwright script to do this, right? Let's write the code first. Let's think: the script will go to the URL, wait for the page to load, find the notice section, then find the selectors, test them by extracting a few items to verify they work.\nWait, first I need to make sure Playwright is installed? Or maybe just write the script and run it with node? Let's first write the script file.\nSo let's use the write tool to create a scrape-xmtorch.js file. The code will:\n1. Import playwright\n2. Launch browser, go to the page\n3. Locate the notification list container, then the items, then title, link, date inside each item\n4. Print out the selectors, and print the first 3 extracted items as verification.\nLet me write that code now.\nThen after writing, run it with exec: node scrape-xmtorch.js, right? But first need to make sure playwright is installed? Oh, maybe first run npm init -y, then npm i playwright? Wait no, maybe the script can use the chromium that comes with it. Wait, or just include installing playwright in the command?\nWait let's first write the script. Let's proceed step by step.\nFirst write the script:\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fb6m09nteq60q78xrzeaisvq","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/scrape-xmtorch.js","content":"const { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  \n  try {\n    await page.goto('http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/zfxxgkml/glfw/', { waitUntil: 'networkidle', timeout: 30000 });\n    \n    // 查找通知公告/政策栏目区域\n    const listContainerSelector = '.content-list';\n    const listItemSelector = '.content-list li';\n    \n    // 验证容器存在\n    const container = page.locator(listContainerSelector);\n    if (!await container.isVisible()) {\n      console.error('公告列表容器未找到');\n      return;\n    }\n    \n    // 提取单个条目内的选择器\n    const titleSelector = 'a';\n    const linkSelector = 'a';\n    const dateSelector = '.date';\n    \n    // 验证选择器，提取前3条测试\n    const items = page.locator(listItemSelector);\n    const count = await items.count();\n    console.log(`找到 ${count} 条公告，提取前3条验证：`);\n    \n    for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(3, count); i++) {\n      const item = items.nth(i);\n      const title = await item.locator(titleSelector).innerText();\n      const link = await item.locator(linkSelector).getAttribute('href');\n      const date = await item.locator(dateSelector).innerText();\n      \n      console.log(`\\n第${i+1}条:`);\n      console.log(`标题: ${title.trim()}`);\n      console.log(`链接: http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn${link}`);\n      console.log(`发布日期: ${date.trim()}`);\n    }\n    \n    // 输出选择器结果\n    console.log(\"\\n===== 最终CSS选择器结果 =====\");\n    console.log(\"1. 公告列表容器选择器:\", listContainerSelector);\n    console.log(\"2. 单个公告条目选择器:\", listItemSelector);\n    console.log(\"3. 公告标题选择器:\", `${listItemSelector} ${titleSelector}`);\n    console.log(\"4. 公告跳转链接选择器:\", `${listItemSelector} ${linkSelector}@href`);\n    console.log(\"5. 公告发布日期选择器:\", `${listItemSelector} ${dateSelector}`);\n    \n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error('访问或提取出错:', err.message);\n  } finally {\n    await browser.close();\n  }\n})();\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773428409215}}
