"_ideConac\"></span>            </div>\n            <div class=\"bot_c\"><ul class=\"footContent\">\n                <li><a href=\"/82686/82773/\">站点地图</a> | <a href=\"/82686/82774/\">联系我们</a></li>\n                <li>主办：厦门火炬高新区管委会&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;技术支持：厦门市信息中心</li>\n                <li> 网站标识码：3502000018&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.beian.gov.cn/portal/registerSystemInfo?recordcode=35020302032660\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;height:20px;line-height:20px;\"><img src=\"/images/ghs.png\" style=\"float:left;\">闽公网安备 35020302032660-47号</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://beian.miit.gov.cn\" target=\"_blank\">闽ICP备16003678号-3</a> </li>\n                <li>版权所有单位：厦门火炬高技术产业开发区管理委员会</li>\n            </ul></div>\n            <div class=\"bot_r\">\n                <script id=\"_jiucuo_\" sitecode=\"3502000018\" src=\"//pucha.kaipuyun.cn/exposure/jiucuo.js\"></script><span id=\"_span_jiucuo\"><img onclick=\"Link('3502000018')\" style=\"margin:0;border:0;cursor: pointer;\" src=\"https://zfwzgl.www.gov.cn/exposure/images/jiucuo.png?v=3502000018\"></span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    \n    </div>\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n$(\"#82446\").addClass(\"on\");\n</script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"../../../images/lazyLoadJS.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\nvar SITEID = 165;\nvar CHNLID = 82446;\nvar CHNLN","cwd":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773428478587}}
{"type":"message","id":"7724a300","parentId":"6c087379","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:01:28.754Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nPerfect! Now I can see the structure. The list container is .tito_list ul, right? Wait no, wait: the .tito_list div contains the ul, then each li is the item. Let's see:\n- 公告列表容器选择器: .tito_list ul\n- 单个公告条目选择器: .tito_list ul li\n- 公告标题选择器: .tito_list ul li a\n- 公告跳转链接选择器: .tito_list ul li a@href\n- 公告发布日期选择器: .tito_list ul li span\nWait let's confirm: yes, each li has an a tag for title/link, and a span for the date. Let's write the final script to verify these selectors work, extract some items, then output the final selectors.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fnnzd37pgeobyd14zxj805qs","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/scrape-xmtorch.js","content":"const { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  \n  try {\n    await page.goto('http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/zfxxgkml/glfw/', { waitUntil: 'domcontentloaded', timeout: 30000 });\n    \n    // 最终确认的选择器\n    const selectors = {\n      listContainer: '.tito_list ul',\n      listItem: '.tito_list ul li',\n      title: '.tito_list ul li a',\n      link: '.tito_list ul li a',\n      date: '.tito_list ul li span'\n    };\n    \n    // 验证选择器有效性\n    const container = page.locator(selectors.listContainer);\n    const itemCount = await container.locator('li').count();\n    console.log(`✅ 验证成功，公告列表共找到 ${itemCount} 条记录，提取前3条验证：`);\n    \n    for (let i=0; i<Math.min(3, itemCount); i++) {\n      const item = container.locator('li').nth(i);\n      const title = await item.locator('a').getAttribute('title');\n      const link = await item.locator('a').getAttribute('href');\n      const date = await item.locator('span').innerText();\n      \n      console.log(`\\n第${i+1}条公告：`);\n      console.log(`标题：${title}`);\n      console.log(`完整链接：http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn${link}`);\n      console.log(`发布日期：${date}`);\n    }\n    \n    // 输出最终结果\n    console.log(\"\\n🎉 最终提取的CSS选择器：\");\n    console.log(\"1. 公告列表容器选择器：\", selectors.listContainer);\n    console.log(\"2. 单个公告条目选择器：\", selectors.listItem);\n    console.log(\"3. 公告标题选择器：\", `${selectors.title}@title`);\n    console.log(\"4. 公告跳转链接选择器：\", `${selectors.link}@href`);\n    console.log(\"5. 公告发布日期选择器：\", selectors.date);\n    \n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error('❌ 提取出错:', err.message);\n  } finally {\n    await browser.close();\n  }\n})();\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773428478589}}
