{"type":"message","id":"259ae0d8","parentId":"fb1e2dd7","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:01:38.592Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nPerfect! The task is done. Now I need to return the result to the main agent. Let's summarize what we found: the selectors are verified working, we extracted 3 latest announcements as proof. Let's write the final response.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"### 厦门火炬高新区政策公告CSS选择器提取结果\n✅ 验证通过，可正常提取最新政策公告：\n---\n#### 提取的CSS选择器：\n1. 公告列表容器选择器：`.tito_list ul`\n2. 单个公告条目选择器：`.tito_list ul li`\n3. 公告标题选择器：`.tito_list ul li a@title`\n4. 公告跳转链接选择器：`.tito_list ul li a@href`\n5. 公告发布日期选择器：`.tito_list ul li span`\n---\n#### 验证结果（最新3条公告）：\n| 发布日期 | 标题 | 链接 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-03-12 | 厦门火炬高新区智能制造服务商认定与退出管理工作机制 | http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn./sbxmzj/202603/t20260312_2985078.html |\n| 2026-03-12 | 厦门火炬高新区管委会关于2月份（总第69期）新引进人才生活补贴拟发放人员名单的公示 | http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn./sbxmzj/202603/t20260312_2985033.html |\n| 2026-03-03 | 厦门火炬高新区管委会关于组织申报2026年专精特新工业企业、中小企业数字化转型试点企业技术改造补助资金的通知 | http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn./sbxmzj/202603/t20260303_2983836.html |"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773428491817}}
